    "updated_at": "2022-02-08T19:53:26Z",
    "body": "R is not executed via the shell. From the error message, it looks like it complains about the CWD being an UNC path. `Context` will need to be changed to remove the `\\\\?\\UNC\\` prefix introduced by `canonicalize` from `current_dir` when possible.",
